

app is module
app purpose "Build a rectangle and print its area and width"
app path app
app imports standard.console
app imports geometry.shapes
app imports geometry.area
app exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout
stdoutWriter scope none

showInt is operation
showInt purpose "Print one whole number on its own line"
showInt invariant none
showInt typeParam none
showInt input value Int64 value
showInt output none
showInt outputOwner none
showInt raises none
showInt effect write console.stdout
showInt uses stdoutWriter
showInt memory heap false
showInt async false
showInt maxRecursion none
showInt label begin loopKind none
showInt label begin within none
showInt label done loopKind none
showInt label done within none
showInt at begin do writeValue
showInt at begin branch ifError writeValue goto done else goto done
showInt at done return ok none

writeValue is call
writeValue rationale "A test program has nowhere to report a failed write"
writeValue in showInt
writeValue invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeValue arg value Int64 value copy
writeValue out none
writeValue ownedBy none
writeValue cleanedBy none
writeValue borrows none
writeValue catch writeError console.WriteError

main is operation
main purpose "Run the case and print what it computes"
main invariant none
main typeParam none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwner none
main raises none
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap false
main async false
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main let seven immutable Int64 7
main let three immutable Int64 3
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0
main at begin do makeRectangle
main at begin do computeArea
main at begin do showArea
main at begin do readWidth
main at begin do showWidth
main at begin return ok okCode

makeRectangle is call
makeRectangle in main
makeRectangle invokes shapes.Rectangle.new
makeRectangle arg width Int64 seven copy
makeRectangle arg height Int64 three copy
makeRectangle out box shapes.Rectangle
makeRectangle ownedBy none
makeRectangle cleanedBy none
makeRectangle borrows none
makeRectangle catch none

computeArea is call
computeArea in main
computeArea invokes area.rectangle
computeArea arg shape shapes.Rectangle box copy
computeArea out boxArea Int64
computeArea ownedBy none
computeArea cleanedBy none
computeArea borrows none
computeArea catch none

showArea is call
showArea in main
showArea invokes showInt
showArea arg value Int64 boxArea copy
showArea out none
showArea ownedBy none
showArea cleanedBy none
showArea borrows none
showArea catch none

readWidth is call
readWidth in main
readWidth invokes shapes.width
readWidth arg shape shapes.Rectangle box copy
readWidth out boxWidth Int64
readWidth ownedBy none
readWidth cleanedBy none
readWidth borrows none
readWidth catch none

showWidth is call
showWidth in main
showWidth invokes showInt
showWidth arg value Int64 boxWidth copy
showWidth out none
showWidth ownedBy none
showWidth cleanedBy none
showWidth borrows none
showWidth catch none
